  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "becb261bd1550651",
      "translationZh": "我们刚刚为 Private Mind 上线了网页搜索功能。这是我们开发的开源应用，可在 iOS 和 Android 上本地运行 LLM。整个卖点看视频就明白了：关闭网页搜索时，Qwen 3 1.7B 会瞎编 Apple 的 September 发布会内容；开启网页搜索后，它就能答对，还会引用 5 个页面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d62f72011c3f76d",
      "translationZh": "有趣的限制在于，一个上下文很短的 1.7B 模型没法直接读完 5 个网页。所以，大部分工作都在于挑选出它实际能看到的那几百个词。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7b4b1e7caf64edaa",
      "translationZh": "没有使用搜索 API。手机上一个隐藏的 WebView 会打开 DuckDuckGo（Brave 和 Mojeek 作为备用），然后我们解析搜索结果页。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdeaf68603eb57d2",
      "translationZh": "它会打开排名靠前的页面，并将其切分成每块约 500 个字符的文本块。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f208176b32601b6",
      "translationZh": "一个设备端嵌入模型（LFM2.5，约 415MB）结合一些关键词匹配，选出最合适的 6 个文本块，其中来自同一页面的最多 3 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "873746f105ab9df5",
      "translationZh": "如果某个说法只有一个网站支持，它的权重就低于两个网站一致认可的说法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "40048933cb91cfb0",
      "translationZh": "模型根据这些文本块作答，并为每个来源附上链接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9a3de98326dc9fd",
      "translationZh": "网页搜索可以针对每个对话单独开关，默认关闭。开启后，手机会发出与浏览器相同的请求。对话本身仍保留在设备上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0b185370d0c4849",
      "translationZh": "所有内容都在 react-native-executorch 上运行，包括 LLM 和嵌入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd43ae87656dd015",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库：https://github.com/software-mansion-labs/private-mind",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
